#x27;ll reject, and how to expedite the process. We handle your entire application from start to approval, or we tell you upfront if it won&#x27;t work. No guessing. No dead ends.</p></div></section><section class="pgx-44 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-45"><div class="pgx-46"><p class="pgx-47">Full Service</p><p class="pgx-111">End-to-End Application</p></div><div class="pgx-46"><p class="pgx-47">Since 2020</p><p class="pgx-111">Walmart Expertise</p></div><div class="pgx-46"><p class="pgx-47">Varies</p><p class="pgx-111">Approval Timeline (Walmart controls)</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-49 bg-shades" id="process"><div class="pgx-34"><h2 class="pgx-311 font-satoshi">From Application to Approval</h2><div class="pgx-497"><div class="pgx-53"><div class="pgx-498">1</div><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Qualification Call</h3><p class="pgx-499">We assess your situation: new seller vs. rejected before, business type, product category, and risk profile.</p></div><div class="pgx-53"><div class="pgx-498">2</div><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Documentation Prep</h3><p class="pgx-499">We guide you through every document: business license, EIN, bank verification, tax ID.</p></div><div class="pgx-53"><div class="pgx-498">3</div><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Application Submission</h3><p class="pgx-499">We submit your application with perfect presentation. Timing, format, documentation order, all optimized.</p></div><div class="pgx-53"><div class="pgx-498">4</div><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Walmart Follow-Up</h3><p class="pgx-499">If Walmart requests more info, we handle communication. If they reject, we advise next steps.</p></div><div class="pgx-53"><div class="pgx-498">5</div><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Approval &amp; Onboarding</h3><p class="pgx-499">Once approved, we help with initial setup, category approvals, and first listings.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-57 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-50"><h2 class="pgx-51 font-satoshi">Why Ecom Circles for Walmart Approval?</h2><p class="pgx-59">We&#x27;ve been through every rejection type and know how to prevent them or recover from them.</p></div><div class="pgx-310"><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Expert Application Handling</h3><p class="pgx-1">We know what Walmart wants to see. Your application is prepared with the right documentation from the start.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Approval Takes Time</h3><p class="pgx-1">Walmart controls the timeline. We handle documentation so you don&#x27;t add unnecessary delays to the process.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Honest Assessment</h3><p class="pgx-1">We tell you upfront if approval is unlikely. You don&#x27;t waste time on a dead end.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Expert Guidance</h3><p class="pgx-1">We know Walmart&#x27;s exact documentation requirements, formatting preferences, and approval criteria.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Rejection Handling</h3><p class="pgx-1">If rejected, we decode why and advise whether to reapply or buy an account.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">One Flat Fee</h3><p class="pgx-1">$2,500 covers the entire process including reapplication if needed. All due upfront. No hidden costs.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-49 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><div><h2 class="pgx-500 font-satoshi">Approval Service Pricing</h2><div class="pgx-501"><div class="pgx-502 pgx-700">This service is currently paused</div><p class="pgx-503">$2,500</p><p class="pgx-504">One flat fee, all due upfront. Covers the entire process through approval.</p><ul class="pgx-124"><li class="pgx-31"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" clas